      "description": "As a Developer,\nI want SFCC to trigger a real-time inventory call to NewStore OMS via MuleSoft when a shopper opens the Find in Boutique modal,\nso that accurate boutique-level stock availability is returned for the selected size.\nThis story covers the integration layer for Find in Boutique. The frontend modal component is covered in SFCC-297. ",
