  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/17901",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n**I want** to see a promotional announcement banner, \n**so that** I am informed of current promotions, offers, or announcements as I browse the site.\n\nReference image (Figma is leading):\n\n![\"image-20260618-040246.png\"](image-20260618-040246.png)\n\n----\n\nThe promotional announcement banner is a thin full-width bar displayed above the global header on all devices but select pages as per configuration.\n\n  - **Page configuration:* The banner needs to be configurable per page (e.g. it may display on Home / PDP / PLP, but it does not on Z.immerse).\n  - **Position flexibility:* The banner needs to be configurable per page on what position it needs to appear (e.g. Top of page on home page or below navigation).\n  - **Rotating behaviour:* The banner supports multiple messages that rotate automatically. Each message can include text and an optional CTA link.\n  - **Content dependency:* Banner copy and rotation configuration is managed in Contentful. The component can be built with mock content prior to Contentful content model being finalised (contentful out of scope)",
