      "body": "Hey User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d - Just reviewing this and some clear ACs, very well written!\n\nAlso a few questions for technical implementation:\n\n1. For the 3 seconds between messages\n  1. This may need to be revisited given Screen Readers will need to time to get to this and read it out loud. \n  1. if on auto-rotation, the developers need to consider aria labels to notify screen readers of new content\n1. Are there controls to see multiple pages and to pause/play the auto-rotation? \n  1. This is generally an accessibility issue with auto playing of carousels - we can likely introduce CSS to stop animations for people with assisted browsers, but also would mean they would need controls and keyboard navigation.\n1. If there are multiple messages, does clicking the x icon close all messages, or just the visible one?\n1. When a user clicks the x icon, and the next time they load the page, do these messages come back or is there a cookie/session the devs need to add to ensure the message is not persisted?\n1. For this being a Contenful managed element, the team needs to do a **Technical Solution Design** and POC on how we integrate the Business Manager properties to Contenful and call those on the component rendering\n1. As this will be a component in the Contenful Studio builder, users can drag-n-drop where this lives on specific pages, but if this is going to live on a PLP and/or PDP or Global across all but Zimmerse, then will likely need a configuration to target specific SFCC Category IDs and Product IDs.",
