{"result":"{
  "id": "18567",
  "key": "SFCC-290",
  "summary": "Product Attributes – SFCC Full Attribute Set Definition & Configuration",
  "description": "**As a** Site Admin, \n\n**I want** all confirmed product attributes defined and configured in SFCC Business Manager, \n\n**so that** the full product data set can be imported from AP21 via MuleSoft and all storefront surfaces — PDP, PLP, integrations, and search — have a stable attribute schema to build against.\n\n----\n\nThis is the master story for the full SFCC product attribute set. It includes all attributes regardless of type or configuration method. A subset of these attributes was previously scoped in SFCC-26 (PDP Product Attributes) to unblock PDP development — SFCC-26 is related to this story. Prices are out of scope — they are managed via pricebook. Stock quantity and availability are out of scope — managed via the NewStore inventory sync.\n\n**Attributes in scope:**\n\n|Attribute|Description|Sample Value|Hierarchy Level|Source|\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|product-id (master)|Master product identifier|4673TS251|Master|AP21|\n|product-id (variant)|Variant product identifier|4673TS251GVSCP0P|Variant|AP21|\n|display-name|Product display name|Illuminate Fitted Blouse|Master|AP21|\n|long-description|Full editorial product description|Crafted from lightweight silk organza, an ornamental print follows the fluid lines of the silhouette...|Master|AP21|\n|short-description|Short description displayed directly on PDP|A dramatic drop-waist skirt lends fluid, voluminous movement in silk.|Master|AP21|\n|upc|UPC / GTIN barcode|9360993226759|Variant|AP21|\n|online-flag|Controls whether product is visible on site|Enabled|Master / Variant Group / Variant|SFCC|\n|searchable-flag|Controls whether product appears in search|true|Master / Variant|SFCC|\n|tax-class-id|Tax class for the product|Taxable Goods|Master|AP21|\n|page-title|SEO meta title|Illuminate Fitted Blouse Guava Seascape Online - Zimmermann|Master|AP21|\n|page-url|SEO-friendly product URL|illuminate-fitted-blouse-guava-seascape|Master|AP21|\n|online-from|Date from which product is visible on site